  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qdr7tDW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2253\" height=\"772\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Cardiac 是一個小型的 Minecraft 模組，引入了一種全新的遊戲玩法機制：被擊敗的怪物會掉落生命光球。玩家可以收集這些光球來恢復生命值，為生存與戰鬥增添簡單的戰略元素。該模組旨在與大多數 Minecraft 模組相容，並提供高度可設定性。即便如此，它仍非常容易安裝，且無需額外設定即可順利融入遊戲中。</p>\n<h3><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B3y6Cjf.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"501\"></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h2><strong>下載：</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>1.21.0: <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cardiac/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.21&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.20.1:&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cardiac/files/5091027\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge/NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.19.2: <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cardiac/files/5091030\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.18.2:<strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cardiac/files/all?page=1&version=1.18.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2hdfX6C.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/SSKirillSS/cardiac\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcardiac\" rel=\"nofollow\">